{"ID":"20240522082247-pc4iqll","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082247-pc4iqll","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082247-pc4iqll\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522093733-vmkg63a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522093733-3wrpzld\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522093733-xuinxoc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:47,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:59\u0026#125;","title":"張孟超醫師的血癌案例","type":"doc","updated":"20240522094119"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522093733-vmkg63a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-vmkg63a","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【血癌案例】"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-n4qdrxg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-n4qdrxg","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"初診11-11-2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-cc2mmci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-cc2mmci","updated":"20240522093848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"J.L. 53歲男性， 2008年1月，西醫診斷為血癌（白血病），查白血球高達6萬。自三月起口服第二代抗血癌新藥（nilotinib），副作用為傷害心臟，三年之間，大約十人，服藥期間，因急性心衰而死。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（倪師曰：心臟管七種癌，此為其一，西醫不知此病正是心臟損傷引起，反以傷害心臟為治法，可笑可嘆。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-nm83puk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-nm83puk","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"註：（99.99﹪的血癌患者口服第一代抗血癌藥gleevec）。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-zfu2vzp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-zfu2vzp","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"至數周前，因無法承受副作用，而停止服用，共服七個月，其間抽過3次骨髓，發病前，嘗長期服用止痛藥（naproxen）五年、降胃酸藥（famotidine）三年、降三酸甘油（gemfibrozil）三年。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-y4fbwoq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-y4fbwoq","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今日來診，胸悶、胸痛徹背，心慌，怔忡，（panic attack）莫名的恐懼，導致無法開車。胃酸逆流，視力模糊，四肢關節酸痛，手足冰冷，不易流汗，自覺煩躁不安，喝很多溫水，故不覺口渴，二便，食欲可，夜尿１次，無陽舉，睡眠差，易醒。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-n4e57um","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-n4e57um","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"※查其舌苔薄白潤，邊有齒痕。鬍子不多但仍有，耳診心點（+++）胸椎第六、七壓痛。腹診：心下痞硬，心下區溫度偏低，觸手冰冷。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-3970ytf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-3970ytf","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"※診斷為胸痺，少陰虛寒證。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-6gjejn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-6gjejn3","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"※方處：四逆湯+枳實薤白桂枝湯+旋覆代赭湯+炮附（漢唐生附烤成）＋活血之品。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-jqmrekm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-jqmrekm","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12-09-08"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-js9p0iq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-js9p0iq","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃酸已除，心慌剩下5﹪，已可自行開車來診所，胸痛減輕，但背痛一樣，自覺痛至椎骨，若吞較硬食物時，感到心臟痛，手足較不冰，頸部及手肘關節仍然酸痛，日便二次，偏軟而稀，T6T7壓痛減輕，仍微痛。睡眠佳，一覺天亮，無夜尿。一周有兩次陽舉"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-xuinxoc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-xuinxoc","updated":"20240522094119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"※處方不變，加入烏頭蜜＜每日炮川烏含量5g＞（以生川烏自己烤成炮川烏，以避免市面上添加之膽巴，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"膽巴會蓄積中毒，傷害肝腎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。）心想若效力有限，則下次考慮生烏頭蜜。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（倪師曰：烏頭比附子更能進入骨頭關節深處，袪寒止痛力也更勝一籌"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（烏頭湯義）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"。但回陽救逆，強心則生附才能擔此大任"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（四逆湯用生附之義）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"。炮附則長於固陽壯腎，峻下逐水劑後用，可防止水回頭"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（真武湯用炮附子之義）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-57x2qq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-57x2qq3","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12-016-09"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-pbwhfbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-pbwhfbd","updated":"20240522094100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胸悶、心慌已完全除去，胸痛徹背減輕，但心悸，手足不冷，口渴改善許多，吞嚥無心痛，但食後打呃。突然問我能否治一痼疾？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（當患者開始關心其它問題，表示原病已大幅改善。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小時候得過慢性腎炎後，從此頻尿，憋不住尿，如果想要憋住尿，立刻自小腹如有物上沖，撞擊胸口，痛苦難當，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（此乃奔豚無疑）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"尤其，工作（郵差）極為不便。腹診：臍上臍下皆動悸，心下痞硬。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-9ahscp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-9ahscp3","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"※方處：四逆湯+枳實薤白桂枝湯+旋覆代赭湯+炮附+烏頭蜜  ＜每日炮川烏含量7g＞+桂枝20g茯苓20g"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-8cblb6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-8cblb6k","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1-06-09"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-7he2p7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-7he2p7x","updated":"20240522094043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無心悸，頻尿改善，但仍憋不住尿，上沖感有，四肢關節仍痛，一周有４天早晨陽舉，體力勝從前，括了一次鬍子。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（奔豚治以桂枝加桂湯，果如倪師所言，應為肉桂，而非加重桂枝）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（也可參考【余無言醫案】，論說精闢）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"查T5T6T7完全無壓痛，我告訴他：「你的血癌已癒，可以去驗血查證。」"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-oi8qj1f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-oi8qj1f","updated":"20240522094033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"註：2-16-09西醫查白血球六千，正常值範圍為四千到八千，患者的西醫恐嚇他，若停止化療，不出三個月必定惡化！並要求抽骨髓檢查。還好他智慧過人，並堅信倪師及經方，告訴他的西醫：「我停止化療早超過三個月，現在不但驗血正常，且身體越來越好，我絕不再作化療、抽骨髓的傻事了。」"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（心想，如果每個人，都有如此不二過的智慧就好了。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"現下，只要再治化療傷害心臟的後遺症，及陳年老毛病即可。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-k0hncg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-k0hncg8","updated":"20240522093917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"※方處：桂芍知母湯+烏頭蜜＜每日炮川烏含量7g＞+清華桂（最上等肉桂）3g打粉，分兩次沖服"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（倪師曰普通肉桂無效）。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-8pixjc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-8pixjc5","updated":"20240522093733"}},{"ID":"20240522093733-kkxv2dx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-kkxv2dx","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1-13-09"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-2gpii77","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-2gpii77","updated":"20240522093929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自訴憋不住尿，及上沖感，二十幾年來，第一次大幅改善，但心臟不舒服，有一點心悸，心慌回頭8﹪，（應是白芍所為，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師曾告誡，胸悶心痛不用白芍"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）胸痛徹背減輕，而未盡除。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-gx72u94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-gx72u94","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"※方處：上方去芍藥。並同時服用烏頭赤石脂丸（丸者緩也，較能停留病灶），囑感胸痛徹背時，舌下含5~10粒以增效。另自行灸關元穴。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-vu2hhj1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-vu2hhj1","updated":"20240522093942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此後以四逆湯+枳實薤白桂枝湯＋桂芍知母湯去芍藥+烏頭蜜＜每日炮川烏含量7~12g＞+清華桂等，化裁加減出入，並同時服用烏頭赤石脂丸，間有鼻過敏（每年春天必發），則加辛夷、石菖蒲、蒼朮等通鼻竅藥（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師治鼻病必用之藥。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-wqfr5ue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-wqfr5ue","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2-17-09"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-rhp8pt8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-rhp8pt8","updated":"20240522093946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胸痛已除，背痛些微，關節痛仍有，髭鬚不盛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（倪師曰髭鬚乃男子精子殘渣，若逆流至淋巴、血液、骨髓則變生淋巴癌、血癌、骨髓癌，故髭鬚盛表示心臟功能正常，能將精子殘渣導入正軌，榮茂髭鬚。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"思之病久及腎，腎主骨生髓，以至督脈不實，再加漢唐斑龍丸，大補督脈髓海，以期收全功。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-zyxi9t8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-zyxi9t8","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2-24-09諸症善，髭鬚盛，諸關節痛減，自覺痛往外散開，至腕以下才有明顯痛感，每日早晨陽舉。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-amyfyew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-amyfyew","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"※查耳診心點、血液點無壓痛；胸椎T5T6T7完全無壓痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-eo6usgh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-eo6usgh","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昨日，似有感冒，汗出、頭身疼痛，鼻塞流涕。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-ue95rbp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-ue95rbp","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可喜，病已出表，太陽病，桂枝湯證，何難之有。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-1rmtyls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-1rmtyls","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"※   處方：桂枝湯全方，不作加減。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-xjzc3qt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-xjzc3qt","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"學生 孟超報告到此            3-2-2009"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-zem4jn4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-zem4jn4","updated":"20240522093951"}},{"ID":"20240522093733-ffxlq42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-ffxlq42","updated":"20240522093958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語:"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上篇案例中所使用的烏頭為川烏頭，現在中國大陸市場上的烏頭已經將川烏與草烏混合一起在賣，殊不知草烏頭為外傷骨折用藥，過去一直是不做內服用藥，就是因為它有劇毒，而我們使用的是正川烏，這種正川烏就是救逆回陽的要藥，尤其使用在類風濕性關節炎的效果是無可取代的，不知道如何正確使用正川烏的中醫師是根本無法治療這類風濕關節炎的，上篇案例中孟超使用了許多帶有毒性的中藥如生附子，烏頭等，也因為他知道如何正確的使用，因此才可以將如此重症自鬼門關前搶救回來，請世上所有開業的中醫師們自己摸著你的良心，然後問問自己，你可以做到嗎？如果你自知無法做到的話，請不要擋路，在這條如何發揚正統中醫學的路上，還是由我們師徒來做，溫病派的假中醫們，你們如果無法使用上篇中的藥物，還要厚著臉皮想要代表中醫界的話，你們就是我們的絆腳石，還會幫倒忙的，所以請你們讓讓路，由我們正統經方家出手來跟西醫對抗，我們之所以要跟西醫對抗，其實發揚真正中醫學還是第二目標，真正的第一而且很急迫的目標，只有一個，就是想救人一命而已，這些原本可以不死的疾病，因為超爛西藥廠的從中做梗，已經讓無數的無辜病患死去，而且他們在死亡之前，還被西藥廠海削一筆龐大的醫藥費用，結果還是很痛苦的死去，無法治病溫病派的你們能安下心嗎？"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-tooc6hw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-tooc6hw","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-yowh5ht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-yowh5ht","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    在台灣上從衛生署中藥委員會主委林宜信開始，處處都是溫病派的中醫當權當道，他們這些中醫師只是西醫的應聲蟲而已，在這種眾庸中醫環繞的生態之下，怎會有優良的中醫出現呢？我今已將人紀傳播給世人，慶幸已經有許多台灣與海外的中醫師加入我們的行列之中，這些未來超強的經方家會一一出現在民眾的周圍，逐漸的經方必將取代溫病學說，我就不信真理會被抹煞掉，希望有良心的溫病派中醫師，都能加入我們經方的陣營，不要繼續誤已跟害人了，人命是無價的，得罪經方家的我們，對你們是一點好處都沒有，哪天你們自己或是你們的親朋好友得到這類重症時，請問你該怎麼辦？是送交給我們經方家來治療呢？還是將他送給西醫，然後上斷頭臺呢？想想清楚吧！"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-83sf5ug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-83sf5ug","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522093733-3wrpzld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093733-3wrpzld","updated":"20240522093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於桃花島2009年03月03日"}]}]}